sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant MW as Main Window
    participant SD as SwiftData Store
    participant MB as Menu Bar
    participant HK as Hotkey Launcher
    participant CB as Clipboard
    participant AI as AI Provider

    U->>MW: Create or edit prompt
    MW->>SD: Debounced save or explicit block save

    U->>MB: Open menu bar
    MB->>SD: Query prompts

    U->>HK: Press configured hotkey
    HK->>SD: Query prompts

    U->>HK: Copy action
    HK->>CB: Write clipboard and update usage
    CB-->>U: Clipboard available

    U->>MW: Run AI action
    MW->>AI: Send provider request
    AI-->>MW: Stream response
    MW->>SD: Persist PromptRun
